<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Promise Bassey Executive Search | Leadership Recruitment</title>
<meta name="description" content="Promise Bassey Executive Search places senior leaders and critical hires with organisations that cannot afford a wrong appointment. Confidential, retained, relationship-led.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Promise Bassey Executive Search">
<meta property="og:description" content="Confidential executive search for organisations that cannot afford a wrong appointment.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1424">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#0b1424;
  --navy-2:#111d33;
  --navy-3:#18274a;
  --gold:#c6a15b;
  --gold-soft:#e3cb97;
  --ivory:#f6f2ea;
  --paper:#fbf9f4;
  --ink:#0e1626;
  --muted:#5d6678;
  --line:rgba(14,22,38,.12);
  --line-dark:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
  --sans:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,100% - 48px);margin-inline:auto}
.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:500;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.4vw,3.4rem)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 30px;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--gold);transition:.35s ease;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--sans);background:transparent}
.btn.solid{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy)}
.btn.solid:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:var(--gold-soft)}
.btn.ghost{color:var(--ivory)}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy)}
.btn svg{width:16px;height:16px;transition:transform .35s}
.btn:hover svg{transform:translateX(4px)}

/* NAV */
header{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:50;transition:.4s ease;padding:22px 0}
header.scrolled{background:rgba(11,20,36,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1;color:var(--ivory)}
.brand b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em}
.brand span{font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-top:7px}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:38px;list-style:none;align-items:center}
nav a.link{font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(246,242,234,.82);position:relative;padding:6px 0}
nav a.link::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:1px;width:0;background:var(--gold);transition:.35s}
nav a.link:hover::after{width:100%}
nav a.link:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{padding:11px 22px;font-size:.7rem}
.burger{display:none;background:none;border:0;width:34px;height:24px;position:relative;cursor:pointer}
.burger i{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;height:1.5px;background:var(--ivory);transition:.3s}
.burger i:nth-child(1){top:4px}.burger i:nth-child(2){top:11px}.burger i:nth-child(3){top:18px}
.burger.open i:nth-child(1){top:11px;transform:rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open i:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open i:nth-child(3){top:11px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}

/* HERO */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;background:
 radial-gradient(1000px 600px at 85% 20%,rgba(198,161,91,.14),transparent 60%),
 radial-gradient(800px 600px at 0% 100%,rgba(35,60,110,.55),transparent 60%),
 linear-gradient(160deg,#0b1424 0%,#0e1a30 55%,#101f3b 100%);color:var(--ivory);overflow:hidden;padding:150px 0 100px}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line-dark) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line-dark) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:90px 90px;opacity:.35;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 40%,#000 0%,transparent 70%);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 40%,#000 0%,transparent 70%)}
.hero-grid{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.9rem,7vw,5.6rem);margin:26px 0 30px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
.hero p.lead{font-size:1.12rem;color:rgba(246,242,234,.78);max-width:560px;font-weight:300}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:44px}
.seal{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;max-width:380px;margin-inline:auto;width:100%}
.seal .ring{position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid rgba(198,161,91,.55);border-radius:50%}
.seal .ring.r2{inset:7%;border-color:rgba(198,161,91,.28)}
.seal .ring.r3{inset:15%;border-color:rgba(198,161,91,.15);border-style:dashed;animation:spin 60s linear infinite}
.seal .mono{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center}
.seal .mono div{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,6.6rem);color:var(--gold);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.04em}
.seal .mono small{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(246,242,234,.65);margin-top:16px}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:34px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.35em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(246,242,234,.5);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.scroll-hint::after{content:"";width:1px;height:42px;background:linear-gradient(var(--gold),transparent);animation:drip 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes drip{0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top}50%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}51%{transform-origin:bottom}100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom}}

/* STRIP */
.strip{background:var(--navy-2);color:var(--ivory);border-block:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.strip .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.strip .item{padding:34px 28px;border-left:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.strip .item:first-child{border-left:0;padding-left:0}
.strip .item b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold-soft);margin-bottom:4px}
.strip .item span{font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(246,242,234,.62)}

section{padding:130px 0}
.sec-head{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:70px}
.sec-head h2{margin:20px 0 22px}
.sec-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}

/* ABOUT */
.about{background:var(--paper)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:90px;align-items:start}
.about h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold)}
.about-copy p{font-size:1.06rem;color:#2b3447;margin-bottom:22px}
.about-copy p:first-child::first-line{font-weight:500}
.sign{margin-top:36px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.sign b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:500}
.sign span{font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}

.portrait{position:relative;margin:48px 0 0 14px;max-width:400px}
.portrait::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-14px 14px 14px -14px;border:1px solid var(--gold);z-index:0}
.portrait img{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;filter:saturate(.92) contrast(1.03)}
.portrait figcaption{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:18px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem}
.portrait figcaption span{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}

/* PRACTICES */
.practices{background:var(--ivory)}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.card{padding:46px 38px 50px;background:var(--paper);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;transition:.45s ease;overflow:hidden}
.card:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
.card:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:0}
.card::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:2px;width:0;background:var(--gold);transition:.5s ease}
.card:hover{background:var(--navy);color:var(--ivory)}
.card:hover::before{width:100%}
.card:hover p{color:rgba(246,242,234,.7)}
.card .num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.2em}
.card h3{font-size:1.75rem;margin:22px 0 14px}
.card p{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted);transition:.45s}

/* PROCESS */
.process{background:var(--navy);color:var(--ivory);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.process::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-200px;top:-200px;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(198,161,91,.18)}
.process .sec-head p{color:rgba(246,242,234,.68)}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;position:relative}
.step{padding:0 34px 0 0;position:relative}
.step::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:22px;left:60px;right:14px;height:1px;background:var(--line-dark)}
.step:last-child::before{display:none}
.step .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--gold);background:var(--navy);position:relative;z-index:1}
.step h3{font-size:1.55rem;margin:28px 0 12px}
.step p{font-size:.93rem;color:rgba(246,242,234,.66)}

/* STANDARDS */
.standards{background:var(--paper)}
.std-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px}
.std-list{list-style:none}
.std-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.std-list li:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.std-list svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:3px}
.std-list h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin-bottom:6px}
.std-list p{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* AUDIENCES */
.aud{background:var(--ivory)}
.aud-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px}
.panel{padding:60px 52px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--ivory);position:relative}
.panel.alt{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.panel h3{font-size:2.3rem;margin:18px 0 18px}
.panel p{color:rgba(246,242,234,.72);margin-bottom:28px}
.panel.alt p{color:var(--muted)}
.panel ul{list-style:none;margin-bottom:34px}
.panel li{padding:11px 0 11px 28px;position:relative;font-size:.95rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.panel.alt li{border-color:var(--line)}
.panel li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:21px;width:12px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
.panel .btn.ghost2{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}
.panel .btn.ghost2:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ivory)}

/* CONTACT */
.contact{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0b1424,#111d33);color:var(--ivory);position:relative}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:90px}
.contact h2{margin:20px 0 26px}
.contact .intro{color:rgba(246,242,234,.72);margin-bottom:46px;max-width:430px}
.detail{padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.detail span{display:block;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px}
.detail a,.detail p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;word-break:break-word}
.detail a:hover{color:var(--gold-soft)}
form{background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--line-dark);padding:50px 46px}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px}
.field{margin-bottom:28px}
label{display:block;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(246,242,234,.65);margin-bottom:10px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:var(--ivory);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:1rem;padding:10px 0 12px;outline:none;transition:.3s;border-radius:0}
select option{color:#111}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--gold)}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:120px}
.honey{position:absolute;left:-9999px;opacity:0}
.note{font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(246,242,234,.5);margin-top:18px}
.status{margin-top:22px;font-size:.95rem;display:none;padding:16px 18px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(198,161,91,.08)}
.status.show{display:block}
.status.err{border-color:#d46a6a;background:rgba(212,106,106,.09)}

/* FOOTER */
footer{background:#070d19;color:rgba(246,242,234,.6);padding:70px 0 34px}
.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:44px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
.foot .brand{margin-bottom:18px}
.foot p{font-size:.88rem;max-width:340px}
.foot ul{list-style:none}
.foot li{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:.88rem}
.foot li a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.copy{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding-top:28px;font-size:.78rem}

/* REVEAL */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .9s ease,transform .9s ease}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.d1{transition-delay:.12s}.d2{transition-delay:.24s}.d3{transition-delay:.36s}

@media (max-width:980px){
  section{padding:90px 0}
  .hero-grid,.about-grid,.std-grid,.contact-grid,.aud-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}
  .seal{max-width:240px}
  .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .card,.card:nth-child(3n){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  .card:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .card:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .card:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;row-gap:56px}
  .step:nth-child(2)::before{display:none}
  .strip .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .strip .item:nth-child(3){border-left:0;padding-left:0}
  nav ul{position:fixed;inset:0;background:var(--navy);flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:30px;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .45s ease}
  nav ul.open{transform:none}
  nav a.link{font-size:1rem}
  .burger{display:block;z-index:60}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .wrap{width:min(1180px,100% - 36px)}
  .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .card,.card:nth-child(n){border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .card:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .step::before{display:none}
  .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
  form{padding:34px 24px}
  .panel{padding:44px 28px}
  .strip .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .strip .item,.strip .item:nth-child(3){border-left:0;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
  .strip .item:first-child{border-top:0}
  .hero{padding-top:130px}
  .scroll-hint{display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.rv{opacity:1;transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header id="top">
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="Promise Bassey Executive Search">
      <b>Promise Bassey</b><span>Executive Search</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <ul id="menu">
        <li><a class="link" href="#about">The Firm</a></li>
        <li><a class="link" href="#practices">Practices</a></li>
        <li><a class="link" href="#process">Method</a></li>
        <li><a class="link" href="#audiences">Clients &amp; Leaders</a></li>
        <li><a class="btn solid nav-cta" href="#contact">Brief a Search</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false"><i></i><i></i><i></i></button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow rv">Retained Executive Search</span>
      <h1 class="rv d1">The right leader changes <em>everything</em> that follows.</h1>
      <p class="lead rv d2">Promise Bassey Executive Search identifies, assesses and secures senior leaders for organisations where a wrong appointment is not an option. Every mandate is handled personally, discreetly and to completion.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions rv d3">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn solid">Brief a Search
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#audiences" class="btn ghost">Confidential Career Enquiry</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="seal rv d2" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ring"></div><div class="ring r2"></div><div class="ring r3"></div>
      <div class="mono"><div>PB<small>Executive Search</small></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">Scroll</div>
</section>

<div class="strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="item rv"><b>Retained</b><span>Exclusive, outcome-focused mandates</span></div>
    <div class="item rv d1"><b>Confidential</b><span>Discretion at every stage of the search</span></div>
    <div class="item rv d2"><b>Direct</b><span>Senior-led from brief to offer</span></div>
    <div class="item rv d3"><b>Verified</b><span>Every shortlisted leader fully referenced</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow rv">The Firm</span>
      <h2 class="rv d1" style="margin-top:22px">Search built on <em>judgement,</em> not volume.</h2>
      <figure class="portrait rv d2">
        <img src="portrait.jpg" alt="Promise Bassey, Founder and Lead Consultant" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'">
        <figcaption>Promise Bassey<span>Founder &amp; Lead Consultant</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="rv">Leadership hiring is decided by a handful of people. The market's strongest executives are rarely looking, rarely visible and rarely moved by a job description. Reaching them takes standing, preparation and a conversation worth their attention.</p>
      <p class="rv d1">Promise Bassey Executive Search works with a deliberately limited number of mandates at any time. That discipline is what lets each search receive full research, direct approach to the right people and a shortlist built on evidence of performance rather than polish of presentation.</p>
      <p class="rv d2">Clients receive a single accountable lead consultant. Leaders receive an honest read on the role, the organisation and where the opportunity sits in their career.</p>
      <div class="sign rv d3"><b>Promise Bassey</b><span>Founder &amp; Lead Consultant</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="practices" id="practices">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow rv">Practices</span>
      <h2 class="rv d1">Where we recruit leaders.</h2>
      <p class="rv d2">Focused search coverage across the functions and sectors where leadership quality decides performance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card rv"><span class="num">01</span><h3>C-Suite &amp; Board</h3><p>Chief executives, managing directors and non-executive directors for growth-stage and established organisations.</p></article>
      <article class="card rv d1"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Finance &amp; Risk</h3><p>CFOs, financial controllers, heads of risk and compliance leaders trusted with capital and accountability.</p></article>
      <article class="card rv d2"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Technology &amp; Digital</h3><p>CTOs, engineering heads, product leaders and digital transformation executives building what comes next.</p></article>
      <article class="card rv"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Commercial &amp; Growth</h3><p>Chief commercial officers, sales directors and marketing leaders who convert strategy into revenue.</p></article>
      <article class="card rv d1"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Operations &amp; Supply Chain</h3><p>Chief operating officers and operational leaders who run complex businesses with precision.</p></article>
      <article class="card rv d2"><span class="num">06</span><h3>People &amp; Culture</h3><p>Chief people officers and HR directors shaping organisation design, talent strategy and culture.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="process" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow rv">Method</span>
      <h2 class="rv d1">A disciplined path from brief to appointment.</h2>
      <p class="rv d2">Four stages, each with a defined output. Clients always know where the search stands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step rv"><div class="dot">I</div><h3>Define</h3><p>We take the brief apart: the mandate, the success measures, the team the leader inherits and the profile that fits. The result is a written search specification you approve.</p></div>
      <div class="step rv d1"><div class="dot">II</div><h3>Map</h3><p>Structured market research identifies every credible leader in scope, including those not actively looking. The target list is built from performance, not from who is easiest to reach.</p></div>
